flowchart TD
    User[User submits product name and description] --> App[Application / classifier function]
    App --> Input{Input valid?}
    Input -->|No| Reject[Return invalid_input JSON]
    Input -->|Yes| Available{Trained model available?}
    Available -->|No| Review[Manual Review queue]
    Available -->|Yes| Model[TF-IDF + Logistic Regression]
    Model -->|Prediction error| Review
    Model --> Output{Category and probabilities valid?}
    Output -->|No| Review
    Output -->|Yes| Confidence{Confidence at least 0.45?}
    Confidence -->|No| Review
    Confidence -->|Yes| Route[Route product to predicted category]
    Route --> Success[Return classified JSON]
    Review --> Fallback[Return manual_review JSON]
